        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5007, 1-1/2 x 5 Rectangular Style Narrow Trim Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek's Narrow Trim Locksets are designed for use on new doors with narrow mounting stiles that have not been prepped with existing holes.  The 1-1/2 x 5 Rectangular Rosette is available in 7 finishes and can be paired with any of Emtek's brass levers or knobs to create your own unique combination that complements your style.  The Stretto Lockset is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions to fit doors from 1-1/4 - 3 inches thick.  It is available with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStretto Narrow Trim Locksets use a tubular latch. This lockset requires a single 1-1/4\" diameter bore hole for the passage function and a 2-hole door preparation for the privacy function and is for new applications only.  It <b>WILL NOT</b> cover an existing 2-1/8\" bore hole.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Style Stretto  Narrow Trim Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of lever/knob to bottom of plate:  2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3 please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4042-specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 4442 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Separate thumb turn privacy bolt engages privacy; emergency release is on exterior rose. Turning inside thumbturn disengages lock, turning lever retracts the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy thumb turn, emergency release trim, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
