                "description": "Emtek's Narrow Trim Locksets are designed for use on new doors with narrow mounting stiles that have not been prepped with existing holes.  The 1-1/2 x 5 Rectangular Rosette is available in 7 finishes and can be paired with any of Emtek's brass levers or knobs to create your own unique combination that complements your style.  The Stretto Lockset is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions to fit doors from 1-1/4 - 3 inches thick.",
